  "smokeResult": "PASS: twenty-eight real ally action SkillStart events each supplied exactly one quote/key. All seven S3 cut-ins and actor-specific SD contacts, plus three awakened variants, used real engine events. Preparation strokes/cut-ins left HP unchanged; final damage contact applied once with one impact sound, healing changed HP once, and shield/support snapshots matched their recipient. Ally targeting used Support links for Lian S3, Kai S2 and Minato S3; no extra damage was invented for visual follow-up strokes. Three awakened fixtures consumed their stacks, and a full unsynchronized gauge clearly required synchronization. Reduced motion retained original feet and unit zoom; leaving during cut-in and special movement removed all temporary captions/performers and stopped audio. Isolated fixtures expose all acquired synchronized skills and seed three stacks for variant coverage; these are animation fixtures rather than natural progression/balance proof. Player saves/settings were untouched. Captures: 19."
